{"ticker":{"symbol":"298020.KS","name":"효성티앤씨","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":303000.0,"change_pct":-0.03194888178913735,"market_cap":1300435697664.0,"pe":5.2289762,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":0.03333333333333333,"week52_low":209500.0,"week52_high":557000.0,"sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Textile Manufacturing","country":"South Korea","city":"Seoul","employees":null,"website":"https://www.hyosungtnc.com","business_summary":"Hyosung TNC Corporation manufactures and sells fiber in South Korea and internationally. It offers spandex, nylon, and polyester. The company also provides general apparel, workwear, and industrial fabrics; and dyed products comprising nylon fabrics, polyester fabrics, nylon/polyester stretch fabrics, and cotton-blend fabrics. In addition, it offers marketing services in the trading sector with steel and chemicals, markets. Further, the company operates Sevit Island, a floating structure built on a floating body on top of the water. Hyosung TNC Corporation was founded in 1957 and is headquartered in Seoul, South Korea.","business_summary_ko":"효성티앤씨(주)는 한국 및 해외에서 섬유를 제조 및 판매하고 있습니다. 스판덱스, 나일론, 폴리에스테르를 제공합니다. 이 회사는 또한 일반 의류, 작업복, 산업용 직물도 제공합니다. 나일론직물, 폴리에스테르직물, 나일론/폴리에스테르 신축성직물, 면혼방직물로 구성된 염색제품 등이 있다. 또한 철강, 화학, 시장 등 무역 부문에서도 마케팅 서비스를 제공하고 있습니다. 또한, 물 위에 떠 있는 부유체 위에 건설된 부유식 구조물인 세빛섬을 운영하고 있습니다. 효성티앤씨(주)는 1957년에 설립되었으며 대한민국 서울에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":8765633330000.0,"rev_lo":8726000000000.0,"rev_hi":8839600000000.0,"rev_g":0.1392,"n":3,"eps":52083.0,"eps_lo":45406.0,"eps_hi":58147.0,"eps_g":19.6925},{"period":"2027","rev":8820066670000.0,"rev_lo":8722000000000.0,"rev_hi":9011700000000.0,"rev_g":0.0062,"n":3,"eps":57946.332,"eps_lo":54499.0,"eps_hi":64069.0,"eps_g":0.1126}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"섬유제조","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":8882729665180.0,"operating_income":123593507460.0,"net_income":11591355470.0,"eps":2686.0},{"period":"2023","revenue":75269